title: Route1Thu2Start
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_thu2_knocked = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_text = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_bottle_seen = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_socks_noted = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_socks = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_tulips = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_chocolates = false>>
<<declare $r1_thu2_answer = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_kiss = "">>
<<declare $r1_thu2_reply = "">>
// The entry node of box R1Dinner2, started by going to bed on the first Thursday
// (bed_3b.yarn). A week later, he comes home from work. However the week went, the socks
// start on the drying rack, washed and dry; her text is waiting on his phone.
// What the box owns is reset here. $r1_thu2_knocked: he has knocked on 3A with the wine;
// the graph step "door" is done once his shoes are off.
<<enter_box R1Dinner2>>
<<set $r1_thu2_knocked to false>>
<<set $r1_thu2_bottle_seen to false>>
<<set $r1_thu2_socks to "">>
<<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "">>
<<fade_out>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<set $r1_socks_at to "rack">>
<<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
<<place Player PlayerFromShop>>
<<face Player right>>
<<card "Thursday. A week later.">>
<<fade_in>>
<<phone PhoneThursday2>>
<<note r1_thu2 "A text from Samantha.">>
You: Home. And my phone's buzzing.
// The player walks freely from here. Knocking on 3A with the wine starts Route1Thu2Door
// (door_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2Door
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by knocking on 3A with the Red Fox 2021 on the second Thursday (door_3a.yarn).
// She stays in her doorway: he gives her things (samantha_3a.yarn) and takes his shoes
// off (door_3a.yarn), in any order.
<<walk Player PlayerTo3A>>
<<face Player right>>
<<wait 1>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<place Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaOut>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Eight o'clock.
// She holds out her hand and waits. PLACEHOLDER line.
{$samantha_name}: Hands first. Then shoes.
<<set $r1_thu2_knocked to true>>
<<note r1_thu2 "Give her what you brought. Shoes off at her door.">>
===
title: Route1Thu2Shoes
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by taking his shoes off at her door on the second Thursday (door_3a.yarn).
{$samantha_name}: Come in. Shoes off.
// She looks down at his feet.
<<if $r1_thu2_socks == "pocket">>
    // He gave them to her at the door and put them on there.
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "socks">>
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. Finally.
<<elseif $r1_socks_at == "feet">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "on">>
    {$samantha_name}: There.
    {$samantha_name}: That's what I wanted.
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "full">>
    {$samantha_name}: Both. You worked it out.
<<elseif $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "pocket">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "socks">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 socks>>
    {$samantha_name}: Grey. And what's in your pocket?
    You: ...
    {$samantha_name}: You brought them and didn't wear them. Put them on. Here.
    // He puts them on, on her doormat.
    {$samantha_name}: Blush. Finally.
<<else>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "off">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_answer to "wine">>
    {$samantha_name}: Grey.
    {$samantha_name}: You thought this was about wine.
    You: Wasn't it?
    {$samantha_name}: Some of it.
<<endif>>
<<if $item_wine_fox>>
    // He didn't hand it over at the door. PLACEHOLDER lines.
    <<set $item_wine_fox to false>>
    {$samantha_name}: And the wine. Were you going to keep it?
    You: No. Here.
<<endif>>
<<done R1Dinner2 door>>
<<note_done thu2_wine>>
<<note_done thu2_socks>>
// She goes back to her stove; he follows her in.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToKitchen3A no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3A>>
<<await_walks>>
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Open the wine. The corkscrew's in the drawer by the sink.
<<note r1_thu2 "Open her wine. Corkscrew: the drawer by her sink.">>
// The player walks around her flat. Sitting at the table with the wine open starts
// Route1Thu2Dinner (table_3a.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2Dinner
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by sitting down at her table on the second Thursday, the wine open
// (table_3a.yarn). The question game's menus are gone: his answers are PLACEHOLDER lines.
<<place Player PlayerSit>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaSit>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Risotto. Not pasta. You'd get used to it.
{$samantha_name}: A game while we eat. I ask, you answer. Honestly.
{$samantha_name}: You get one question back.
You: And if I lie?
{$samantha_name}: I'll know. You saw how that went on Sunday.
{$samantha_name}: Did you think about me this week?
You: ...More than I'd like.
{$samantha_name}: That's the right amount.
{$samantha_name}: Last week at the sink. When I told you not to turn around.
{$samantha_name}: What did that feel like?
You: Easy.
{$samantha_name}: Mm. It was meant to.
{$samantha_name}: Your turn. One question.
<<if is_done("R1Dinner2", "notebook")>>
    You: What else is in the notebook?
    {$samantha_name}: Seven pages. You're on four of them.
    <<done R1Dinner2 pages>>
    You: Four?
    {$samantha_name}: That was your question.
<<else>>
    You: Why me?
    {$samantha_name}: Because you answer the door.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Leave the dishes. Tonight you're done when I say you're done.
{$samantha_name}: And I say you're done.
// She walks him to her door and stops him there.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaKiss3A no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerKiss3A>>
<<await_walks>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
{$samantha_name}: Stand there. Hands by your sides.
{$samantha_name}: Don't move.
<<done R1Dinner2 dinner>>
<<note r1_thu2 "Stand still.">>
// The player is in control: standing still or reaching for her are actions on her
// (samantha_3a.yarn). Standing still starts Route1Thu2Kiss.
===
title: Route1Thu2Kiss
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by standing still at her door after the second dinner (samantha_3a.yarn).
<<if $r1_thu2_kiss == "">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_kiss to "still">>
<<endif>>
<<done R1Dinner2 wait>>
// She kisses him. Short. She steps back first.
<<wait 1>>
<<if $r1_thu2_kiss == "still">>
    {$samantha_name}: Good boy.
    You: ...
    {$samantha_name}: You heard me.
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: There. Was that so hard?
<<endif>>
<<open_door Door3A>>
<<walk Player PlayerOutOf3AKiss>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: Goodnight, neighbour.
<<close_door Door3A>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<wait 1>>
// Home.
<<face Player up>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
<<face Player down>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
<<phone PhoneThursday2Night>>
<<note r1_thu2 "A text from Samantha.">>
You: ...My phone. Already.
// The player is in control in 3B. Going to bed after reading her text starts
// Route1Thu2End (bed_3b.yarn).
===
title: Route1Thu2End
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by going to bed after her night text (bed_3b.yarn): the end of route 1 so far.
<<fade_out>>
<<card "Thursdays.">>
<<end_demo>>
===
